        {
          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "Against the wall of the house, he built floors all around, against the walls of the house all around, both of the temple and of the inner sanctuary; and he made side rooms all around.",
      "ko": "또 전의 벽 곧 성소와 지성소의 벽에 연접하여 돌아가며 다락들을 건축하되 다락마다 돌아가며 골방들을 만들었으니",
      "source_text_hash": "9b21f4961bf47a39c0384544b2fd451c4da7f0df09cd8e7802825b2e40fd533b",
      "translation_text_hash": "09b14c4da720e9c77fd72d895825202ef9ca2719167c4dd45bfa12e4c1fa694c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "또 전의 벽 곧 성소와 지성소의 벽에 연접하여 돌아가며 다락들을 건축하되 다락마다 돌아가며 골방들을 만들었으니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "09b14c4da720e9c77fd72d895825202ef9ca2719167c4dd45bfa12e4c1fa694c"
