      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "He built the floors all along the house, each five cubits high; and they rested on the house with timbers of cedar.",
      "ko": "또 온 전으로 돌아가며 고가 다섯 규빗 되는 다락방을 건축하되 백향목 들보로 전에 연접하게 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8d45b58f96320b91529e42abba83f89e774ec8ac5d36c5164cdc3cc96cd4a927",
      "translation_text_hash": "3f4ea0fd51b0d6ddfedb08eb7a411f25d5453d10e42cf39e59d92a9a1cc06012",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
