      "en": "Within the inner sanctuary was twenty cubits in length, and twenty cubits in width, and twenty cubits in its height. He overlaid it with pure gold. He covered the altar with cedar.",
      "ko": "그 내소의 속이 장이 이십 규빗이요 광이 이십 규빗이요 고가 이십 규빗이라 정금으로 입혔고 백향목 단에도 입혔더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b704109842070cc509d6a72b2ee9ca40762c12bf5048549ceeebe8814938f6ad",
      "translation_text_hash": "cb802a38fa0d64d371a717d8799d4de67702d8ae4f679c275bc5eed9b360b10d",
